        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PPH3520/DP2575 Solid Brass Pull Plate 3-1/2\" Wide x 20\" High With 11\" Solid Brass Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCommon size door pull plate primarily used in restaurants, warehouses and stores, but are popular in homes as well. The plate is 3-1/2\" wide and 20\" long; and is made of .050\" thick high quality solid brass for longevity. While the grip is 11\". It is made out of solid brass with 7 finishes. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-push-plate-3-5-x-20-inch-deltana-pp3520\"><b>3-1/2\" x 20\" Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana PPH3520/DP2575 Pull Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Mounting Centers: 10\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PPH3520-DP2575.pdf?v=1704262212\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PPH3520/DP2575 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
